OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer 'making sense of
OL,4,Agrief' with archive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photographer has embarked on the
OL,7,Fmammoth task of recording her father's
OL,8,Flife by archiving his workshop and
OL,9,Fcollection of "treasures".
OL,11,FJohn Taylor, who died suddenly at the
OL,12,Fage of 66, was his family's handyman
OL,13,Fand fixer with a passion for restoring
OL,14,Fcars and scooters and a tool for every
OL,15,Foccasion.
OL,17,FThese, alongside his collection of
OL,18,Fesoteric and mundane items, were stored
OL,19,Fin the family home for years, but when
OL,20,Fit was due to be sold his daughter
OL,21,FLouise decided to photograph everything
OL,22,Fbefore it was disposed of.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
