OL,3,GNEWSAPhotographer 'making sense of
OL,4,Agrief' with archive
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe hopes the result, "Archiving Dad",
OL,7,Fwill resonate with anyone who has
OL,8,Fsuffered grief, and with the aid of a
OL,9,FKickstarter fund aims to turn it into a
OL,10,Flimited number of bespoke books.
